#: src/reference/guide/build-layout.md:6
msgid "Build layout"
msgstr "构建布局"

#: src/reference/guide/build-layout.md:9
msgid ""
"sbt uses conventions for file placement to make it easy to dive into a new "
"sbt build:"
msgstr "sbt 使用文件放置约定，便于快速上手新的 sbt 构建："

#: src/reference/guide/build-layout.md:40
msgid "The local root directory `.` is the starting point of your build."
msgstr "本地根目录 `.` 是您构建的起点。"

#: src/reference/guide/build-layout.md:41
msgid ""
"In sbt's terminology, the _base directory_ is the directory containing the "
"subproject. In the above, `.`, `subproject-core`, and `subproject-util` are "
"base directories."
msgstr ""
"在 sbt 的术语中，_base directory_（基目录）是包含子项目的目录。在上面的示例"
"中，`.`、`subproject-core` 和 `subproject-util` 都是基目录。"

#: src/reference/guide/build-layout.md:42
msgid ""
"The build definition is described in `build.sbt` (actually any files named "
"`*.sbt`) in the local root directory."
msgstr ""
"构建定义在本地根目录的 `build.sbt`（实际上是任何名为 `*.sbt` 的文件）中描述。"

#: src/reference/guide/build-layout.md:43
msgid "The sbt version is tracked in `project/build.properties`."
msgstr "sbt 版本在 `project/build.properties` 中跟踪。"

#: src/reference/guide/build-layout.md:44
msgid ""
"Generated files (compiled classes, packaged jars, managed files, caches, and "
"documentation) will be written to the `target` directory by default."
msgstr ""
"生成的文件（编译后的类、打包的 jar、托管文件、缓存和文档）默认会写入 "
"`target` 目录。"

#: src/reference/guide/build-layout.md:47
msgid "Build support files"
msgstr "构建支持文件"

#: src/reference/guide/build-layout.md:49
msgid ""
"In addition to `build.sbt`, `project` directory can contain `.scala` files "
"that define helper objects and one-off plugins."
msgstr ""
"除了 `build.sbt` 之外，`project` 目录还可以包含定义辅助对象和一次性插件的 "
"`.scala` 文件。"

#: src/reference/guide/build-layout.md:66
msgid ""
"You may see `.sbt` files inside `project/`, which is typically used to "
"declare plugins. See [Plugin basics](./plugin-basics.md)."
msgstr ""
"您可能会在 `project/` 内看到 `.sbt` 文件，通常用于声明插件。请参阅 [插件基础]"
"(./plugin-basics.md)。"

#: src/reference/guide/build-layout.md:69
msgid "Source code"
msgstr "源代码"

#: src/reference/guide/build-layout.md:71
msgid ""
"sbt uses the same directory structure as [Maven](https://maven.apache.org/) "
"for source files by default (all paths are relative to the base directory):"
msgstr ""
"sbt 默认使用与 [Maven](https://maven.apache.org/) 相同的目录结构存放源文件"
"（所有路径均相对于基目录）："

#: src/reference/guide/build-layout.md:91
msgid ""
"Other directories in `src/` will be ignored. Additionally, all hidden "
"directories will be ignored."
msgstr "`src/` 中的其他目录将被忽略。此外，所有隐藏目录也将被忽略。"

#: src/reference/guide/build-layout.md:94
msgid ""
"Source code can be placed in the project's base directory as `hello/"
"app.scala`, which may be OK for small projects, though for normal projects "
"people tend to keep the projects in the `src/main/` directory to keep things "
"neat."
msgstr ""
"源代码可以放在项目的基目录中，如 `hello/app.scala`，这对于小项目可能可以接"
"受，但对于常规项目，人们倾向于将项目放在 `src/main/` 目录中以保持整洁。"

#: src/reference/guide/build-layout.md:104
msgid "Configuring version control"
msgstr "配置版本控制"

#: src/reference/guide/build-layout.md:106
msgid ""
"Your `.gitignore` (or equivalent for other version control systems) should "
"contain:"
msgstr "您的 `.gitignore`（或其他版本控制系统的等效文件）应包含："

#: src/reference/guide/build-layout.md:113
msgid ""
"```admonish note\n"
"Note that this deliberately has a trailing `/` (to match only directories)\n"
"and it deliberately has no leading `/` (to match `project/target/` in\n"
"addition to plain `target/`).\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
